OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe possible assault
OL,4,Alinked to video of Enoch Burke and
OL,5,Achurch leader
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurke has been in a long-running legal
OL,8,Fbattle for defying court orders to stay
OL,9,Faway from a school which dismissed him
OL,10,Ffor gross misconduct arising out of his
OL,11,Frefusal to use the pronouns preferred
OL,12,Fby a transgender student.
